    "title": "Bob's Burgers",
    "body": "The Belcher family's burger restaurant on Ocean Avenue, with the family's apartment upstairs — that second door on the left is the stairs up to it.\n\n## The Burger of the Day\nThe chalkboard pun burger changes constantly and is almost always better than business is. Bob takes it more seriously than nearly anything else.\n\n## Notes\n- It's Your Funeral Home & Crematorium is next door on one side; the perpetually doomed for-lease storefront is on the other\n- Directly across the street from Jimmy Pesto's Pizzeria, to Bob's eternal irritation\n- The grand re-re-re-opening happened in the very first episode"
